# **Rhythm Culture Welcomes you**

Hi everyone, We hope March has found you well! Can you believe it is the Easter holidays in 5 weeks? Wow, time flys when you are having fun! This month you will see Rhythm Cultures website take an exciting new look along with more detailed information in an expansive new format.  You will also notice a slight change to our newsletters with added extras such as competitions, 'Book of the Month' and our lovely Nutritionist has returned with some vital goodness! So, here we are about to run a second 5 week course in Palmwoods and Maroochydore for the year and getting a few extra exciting projects on board for 2014.  We would like to say a massive thank you to all those that contributed their feedback for the previous 5 week course, we really appreciate your time. Your suggestions and comments are invaluable to us and helps us change whats not working and expand on what is.  Thanks again! As you will see below, we have announced the dates and location of our NEW open Noosa class, along with an exciting NEW advanced drumming class in Palmwoods, which we encourage all drummers with previous experience to be apart of. Be sure not to miss out on upcoming performance dates for Rhythm Culture students and Co-op members and Bassidi tour dates confirmed and locked in! We hope you all enjoy and encourage feedback on all fronts! Peace, Love and Rhythm Rhythm Culture
